# Picknic app — build-time public config.
#
# Rsbuild (via rspeedy) auto-loads these files and inlines ONLY vars prefixed
# PUBLIC_ into `import.meta.env`. Load order (later wins):
#   .env  <  .env.{development|production}  <  .env.local  <  .env.{mode}.local
#
# Committed:  .env.development, .env.production  (non-secret per-mode defaults)
# Gitignored: .env.local, .env.*.local          (your machine-specific overrides)
#
# Base URL of the .NET API. In development, src/api/config.ts defaults to
# http://<dev-bundle-host>:8080 so web preview and a physical device can both
# reach a local API. Set this only when you need a specific API host:
# PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://192.168.1.23:8080
